                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Congressional Republicans have been saying they have an alternative health care plan for fifteen years and have not delivered. The government may be reopened, but families are now weeks away from\u00a0paying\u00a0higher premiums that could force millions to choose between their coverage and basic necessities. Democrats are fighting to protect your health care while Congressional Republicans scramble to come up with anything\u00a0that would actually lower costs.\nhttps://t.co/D4bv3WEO0l",
