                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Millions of Americans are losing health coverage and facing skyrocketing costs because of repeated Republican attacks on Medicaid, the ACA, and Medicare. As hospitals close and patients struggle to access care, including telehealth, I\u2019m fighting to protect affordable coverage and make permanent the telehealth flexibilities that families rely on every day.",
