                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Rural communities deserve the same strong, reliable health care as anywhere else. Today on #NationalRuralHealthDay, we honor the caregivers and organizations who power rural America and keep our communities healthy. I\u2019ll keep fighting to restore rural hospital funding and extend telehealth coverage permanently so that rural areas will always have access to care.",
