                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "We need to ensure everyone has access to health care. That\u2019s why I introduced a bill to make telehealth coverage permanent across America. Telemedicine should be available to everyone. It saves lives and saves money! That's why my bill H.R.4206, the CONNECT for Health Act, needs to be signed into law.",
