                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Costs are up from last year due to inflation and Trump's tariffs, and everyone is feeling the squeeze. I'm working to pass legislation that will lower costs for Americans for utilities, health care, and groceries. I invite all my colleagues - Democrat and Republican - to join me to pass this legislation, or costs will only continue to rise.",
