                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Americans who continue to see rising costs everywhere in their lives can\u2019t get ahead, and the American Dream is deferred. If we\u2019re serious about building a better America for current and future generations, we can\u2019t allow health insurance costs to skyrocket. Congressional Republicans need to work with Democrats to extend ACA premium tax credits and lower costs for Americans.",
