                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Hepatitis B vaccines for infants have been standard practice for over 30 years and they\u2019ve reduced the rates of liver diseases caused by Hep B by 99 percent. Protecting children from health risks should be common sense and it\u2019s been proven that these vaccines work. If this administration truly wants to Make America Healthy Again, we need to stick with the science.\n\nhttps://t.co/VAUNh2PY64",
